    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_brother_01",
      "hash64": "91D444A7ABA8EA9F",
      "text": "Sei riuscita a trovare la Bottega Momo?[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_rival_02",
      "hash64": "D973AD3B423F1C1C",
      "text": "Sì, l’ho trovata subito! È vicinissima![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_rival_03",
      "hash64": "D973AE3B423F1DCF",
      "text": "Però non c’era nessuno, quindi ho lasciato\\ni soldi sul bancone. Spero vada bene.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_brother_02",
      "hash64": "91D445A7ABA8EC52",
      "text": "Non c’è problema. Fanno tutti così quando\\nla signora non c’è.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_friend_01",
      "hash64": "E9A59ED99AFB3197",
      "text": "Ooh... Una cosa simile è impensabile a Paldea...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_botan_02",
      "hash64": "726D32FC947150CA",
      "text": "Mh? Nemi, hai mangiato qualcosa?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_rival_04",
      "hash64": "D973AB3B423F18B6",
      "text": "Sì, c’era un mochi... e un bigliettino che invitava\\na prenderlo.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_friend_02",
      "hash64": "E9A59FD99AFB334A",
      "text": "Riben, non si può cambiare canale?\\c\\nÈ da un’ora che continua a girare ’sto video\\npromozionale del paese![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
